These are the upstream human-written reference solution and tests, not the
source of a successful agent submission. All imported files are unchanged;
upstream.json records original paths and cryptographic hashes.

SREGym's separate docker/stripe-marathon/backend.py adds PostgreSQL durability,
transactional API responses and a separate worker. receiver.py provides a local
durable webhook sink. They are SREGym adaptations, not upstream functionality.
